  HolMultiLib.Paths's dependencies (convex.ml's `ConvexDeps`, the extra
  theorems from Session, SessionLibrary and SessionMultiLib, and the
  procedures), and exports every theorem and procedure by name.  Importing
  this module is `needs "Multivariate/paths.ml"`: its own `needs` are the
  imports of SessionMultiLib.Homology and SessionMultiLib.Convex, and each
  bundle is built by `initialize` when the module is loaded, in file order.
-/

